T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Basic greetings) Tj
T*
(Hello! - ¡Hola! A neutral greeting for most situations.) Tj
T*
(Hi! - ¡Hola! A friendly, informal greeting.) Tj
T*
(Good morning. - Buenos días. Use it in the morning.) Tj
T*
(Good afternoon. - Buenas tardes. Use it after midday.) Tj
T*
(Good evening. - Buenas tardes/noches. Use it when greeting someone in the evening.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Introduce yourself) Tj
T*
(The simplest patterns are I'm + name and My name is + name .) Tj
T*
(Hi, I'm Alex. - Hola, soy Alex.) Tj
T*
(Hello, my name is Sara. - Hola, me llamo Sara.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Ask someone's name) Tj
T*
(Use What's your name? - ¿Cómo te llamas? In a more formal situation, you can say May I ask) Tj
T*
(your name? - ¿Puedo preguntarte tu nombre?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Ask how someone is) Tj
T*
(How are you? - I'm fine, thanks.) Tj
T*
(¿Cómo estás? - Estoy bien, gracias.) Tj
T*
(How's it going? - Pretty good!) Tj
T*
(¿Qué tal? - ¡Bastante bien!) Tj
T*
