(2. Contractions) Tj
T*
(In everyday English, contractions are very common: I'm, you're, he's, she's, it's, we're,) Tj
T*
(they're .) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Negative sentences) Tj
T*
(Put not after the verb: I am not tired. - No estoy cansado/a. She isn't late. - Ella no) Tj
T*
(llega tarde. We aren't ready. - No estamos listos/as.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Questions) Tj
T*
(Move the verb before the subject: Are you ready? - ¿Estás listo/a? Is she at home? - ¿Está) Tj
