(Hedging makes an opinion less absolute. It helps you show whether you are giving a personal) Tj
T*
(view, a tentative deduction, or an impression based on evidence.) Tj
T*
(I reckon is informal and especially associated with British and Australian English. I guess) Tj
T*
(is widespread and often tentative. I believe is neutral to slightly formal. It seems like) Tj
T*
(focuses on an impression.) Tj
T*
(2. Bilingual examples) Tj
T*
(I reckon we should finish this task first.) Tj
T*
(Creo que deberíamos terminar esta tarea primero.) Tj
T*
(I guess they changed the date because of the weather.) Tj
T*
(Supongo que cambiaron la fecha por el tiempo.) Tj
T*
(I believe continuous learning is important.) Tj
T*
ET
