(1. Meaning and use) Tj
T*
(Take off is a multi-meaning phrasal verb. With aircraft it means leave the ground; with) Tj
T*
(clothing it means remove an item.) Tj
T*
(For success, a business, product, career, or trend can take off when it suddenly becomes) Tj
T*
(popular or successful.) Tj
T*
(2. Bilingual examples) Tj
T*
(The flight is scheduled to take off at 8:30 a.m.) Tj
T*
