T*
(Have you spoken to Marta yet?) Tj
T*
(¿Ya has hablado con Marta?) Tj
T*
(3. Rules and common mistakes) Tj
T*
(In negative present-perfect sentences, yet normally goes at the end: I haven't received the) Tj
T*
(email yet. It is also common in questions: Have you finished yet? - ¿Ya has terminado?) Tj
T*
(Compare: I've never written a novel - Nunca he escrito una novela - describes life) Tj
T*
(experience; I haven't finished my novel yet - Todavía no he terminado mi novela - describes) Tj
T*
(an unfinished expected action.) Tj
