T*
(? were / would travel) Tj
T*
(? lived / would speak) Tj
T*
(? studied / would get) Tj
T*
(? were / would apply) Tj
T*
(? didn't have / would stay) Tj
T*
(Después de if va Past Simple; el resultado utiliza would + infinitivo sin to .) Tj
T*
(Para recordar: If I had..., I would... = «Si tuviera..., haría...». Es una hipótesis del) Tj
T*
(presente o futuro.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
