T*
(Past Perfect = had + participio: had studied, had gone, had known .) Tj
T*
(Resultado = would have + participio: would have passed, would have gone, would have known .) Tj
T*
(También puedes invertir el orden: I would have helped you if I had known. No cambia el) Tj
T*
(significado.) Tj
T*
(Parte con if Resultado alternativo If I had saved more I would have bought a car. If she had) Tj
T*
(left earlier she would have arrived on time. If we had known we would have helped .) Tj
T*
(Para hablar de posibilidad también puedes usar might have o could have : If she had applied,) Tj
T*
(she might have received the grant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Ejemplos bilingües) Tj
T*
(Dinero: If I had saved more money, I would have bought a house.) Tj
