(Si hubiera ahorrado más dinero, habría comprado una casa.) Tj
T*
(Trabajo: If I had arrived earlier, I wouldn't have missed the interview.) Tj
T*
(Si hubiera llegado antes, no habría perdido la entrevista.) Tj
T*
(Estudios: If she had applied for the scholarship, she might have received it.) Tj
T*
(Si hubiera solicitado la beca, podría haberla conseguido.) Tj
T*
(Vida cotidiana: If I had known about the problem, I would have helped you.) Tj
T*
(Si hubiera sabido lo del problema, te habría ayudado.) Tj
T*
(Transporte: If we had taken the bus, we would have arrived on time.) Tj
T*
(Si hubiéramos cogido el autobús, habríamos llegado a tiempo.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
