(1. Meaning and use) Tj
T*
(To be honest introduces a frank or personal comment. It often signals that the speaker is) Tj
T*
(about to say what they genuinely think or feel.) Tj
T*
(It commonly appears at the beginning followed by a comma, but it can also appear later: I) Tj
T*
(don't like it, to be honest. - No me gusta, la verdad.) Tj
T*
