T*
(I don't like it, to be honest.) Tj
T*
(No me gusta, la verdad.) Tj
T*
(3. Rules and common mistakes) Tj
T*
(It is natural in speech and informal or semi-formal writing. In a formal report or academic) Tj
T*
(essay, more neutral phrasing is usually preferable.) Tj
T*
(Avoid using it at the start of every answer. Repetition can sound mechanical and may) Tj
T*
(accidentally imply that other statements are less honest.) Tj
T*
(Study tip: Say the English example aloud before checking the Spanish translation.) Tj
T*
